\b 4. Input Embeddings\par
\b0 Computers cannot understand words directly. Therefore, each word is converted into numerical vectors called embeddings.\par
\b Example\par
\b0 Sentence: "I Love AI"\par
\par
I      \f3\u8594?\f0\lang16393  [0.12, 0.45, 0.91]\par
Love   \f3\u8594?\f0\lang16393  [0.88, 0.67, 0.25]\par
AI     \f3\u8594?\f0\lang16393  [0.73, 0.34, 0.91]\par
\b Benefits\par

\pard{\pntext\f4\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf4\pnindent360{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li720\sa160\sl276\slmult1\b0 Captures semantic meaning.\par
{\pntext\f4\'B7\tab}Similar words have similar vector representations.\par
{\pntext\f4\'B7\tab}Converts language into machine-understandable form.\par

\pard\widctlpar\sa160\sl276\slmult1\par
\b 5. Positional Encoding\par
\b0 Since Transformers process all words simultaneously, they need information about word order.\par
\b Purpose\par

\pard{\pntext\f4\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf4\pnindent360{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li720\sa160\sl276\slmult1\b0 Maintains sequence information.\par
{\pntext\f4\'B7\tab}Distinguishes between sentences with the same words but different order.\par

\pard\widctlpar\sa160\sl276\slmult1\b Example\par
\b0 "The dog chased the cat"\par
"The cat chased the dog"\par
Both contain the same words but have different meanings. Positional Encoding helps the model understand this difference.\par
\b Benefits\par

\pard{\pntext\f4\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf4\pnindent360{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li720\sa160\sl276\slmult1\b0 Preserves grammar.\par
{\pntext\f4\'B7\tab}Maintains sentence structure.\par
{\pntext\f4\'B7\tab}Improves contextual understanding.\par

\pard\widctlpar\sa160\sl276\slmult1\par
\b 6. Self-Attention Mechanism\par
\b0 Self-Attention is the most important component of the Transformer Architecture.\par
It allows every word in a sentence to examine every other word and determine which words are most relevant.\par
\b\par
Example\par
\b0 Sentence:\par
\i "The bank approved the loan because it had enough funds."\i0\par
The model determines that:\par
"It" \f3\u8594?\f0\lang16393  Bank\par
rather than:\par
"It" \f3\u8594?\f0\lang16393  Loan\par
\b Benefits\par

\pard{\pntext\f4\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf4\pnindent360{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li720\sa160\sl276\slmult1\b0 Captures context efficiently.\par
{\pntext\f4\'B7\tab}Handles long-range dependencies.\par
{\pntext\f4\'B7\tab}Improves language understanding.\par

\pard\widctlpar\sa160\sl276\slmult1\par
\b 7. Query, Key, and Value (QKV)\par
\b0 Self-Attention relies on three vectors:\par
\b Query (Q)\par
\b0 Represents what a word is looking for.\par
\b Key (K)\par
\b0 Represents what information the word contains.\par
\b Value (V)\par
\b0 Contains the actual information of the word.\par
\b Working Process\par

\pard 
{\pntext\f0 1.\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlbody\pnf0\pnindent360\pnstart1\pndec{\pntxta.}}
\fi-360\li720\sa160\sl276\slmult1\b0 Generate Query, Key, and Value vectors.\par
{\pntext\f0 2.\tab}Compare Query with all Keys.\par
{\pntext\f0 3.\tab}Calculate attention scores.\par
{\pntext\f0 4.\tab}Apply Softmax function.\par
{\pntext\f0 5.\tab}Generate weighted Value outputs.\par

