\b 8. Multi-Head Attention\par
\b0 Instead of using a single attention mechanism, Transformers use multiple attention heads.\par
\b Example\par
\b0 Different attention heads focus on:\par

\pard{\pntext\f4\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf4\pnindent360{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li720\sa160\sl276\slmult1 Grammar relationships\par
