{\pntext\f4\'B7\tab}Captures different perspectives of data.\par

\pard\widctlpar\sa160\sl276\slmult1\par
\b 9. Feed Forward Neural Network (FFN)\par
\b0 After attention calculations, data passes through a Feed Forward Neural Network.\par
\b Functions\par

\pard{\pntext\f4\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf4\pnindent360{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li720\sa160\sl276\slmult1\b0 Learns complex patterns.\par
