\b 14. Masked Self-Attention\par
\b0 Masked Attention prevents the model from seeing future words during prediction.\par
\b Example\par
\b0 Input:\par
"The weather is..."\par
While predicting the next word, the model cannot see future words.\par
\b Benefits\par

\pard{\pntext\f4\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf4\pnindent360{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li720\sa160\sl276\slmult1\b0 Prevents cheating during training.\par
